00:09:14.980 --> 00:09:17.788
<v Host>Quiz time. Listen and answer.

00:09:18.388 --> 00:09:23.572
<v Slow>値上げは、いつ買うきっぷからですか。

00:09:24.371 --> 00:09:27.539
<v Host>Tickets bought from March thirteenth next year.

00:09:28.139 --> 00:09:34.211
